WEBVTT

01:26.650 --> 01:29.770
[Glory]

01:30.510 --> 01:32.920
[Episode 19]

01:33.050 --> 01:35.509
[Xinfang Pavilion]

01:34.920 --> 01:36.870
Tailor Chen has been waiting outside

01:36.870 --> 01:38.070
since early morning.

01:38.280 --> 01:39.479
After Mr. Lu finished breakfast,

01:39.479 --> 01:41.680
he called Mr. Chen in
to take measurements.

01:41.680 --> 01:42.950
He hasn't gone out.

01:44.039 --> 01:45.039
Did you hear that?

01:45.759 --> 01:46.400
That Yang fellow

01:46.400 --> 01:47.920
clearly harbors ill intent.

01:47.920 --> 01:49.400
He's shifting the blame,

01:49.640 --> 01:50.950
turning you against Mr. Lu

01:50.950 --> 01:52.680
and scheming to ruin your marriage.

01:52.680 --> 01:53.870
Such a man should be arrested

01:53.870 --> 01:55.789
and subjected to harsh interrogation.

01:55.789 --> 01:57.070
We were going to pay a sick visit.

01:57.070 --> 01:58.530
There was nothing to hide.

01:59.070 --> 02:00.530
If he followed us, let him.

02:00.620 --> 02:02.000
With all your talk of violence,

02:02.000 --> 02:04.230
are you trying to turn our Rong family
into a nest of thugs?

02:04.230 --> 02:05.280
Besides, Mr. Yang

02:05.280 --> 02:07.280
is an honored guest of Grandmother.

02:07.510 --> 02:09.039
I'll inform her about this.

02:09.310 --> 02:10.370
How he is dealt with

02:10.560 --> 02:11.960
will be for her to decide.

02:12.240 --> 02:13.630
You're about to get married.

02:13.630 --> 02:14.870
Why keep them around?

02:15.280 --> 02:16.590
Take this chance to drive them away.

02:16.590 --> 02:19.390
If they stay longer,
there will surely be trouble.

02:20.520 --> 02:22.360
If Grandmother insists on keeping them,

02:22.360 --> 02:24.079
could it be that she still hasn't given up

02:24.079 --> 02:25.680
on matching you with someone else?

02:25.680 --> 02:27.800
I'm not the only daughter
in our Rong family.

02:27.800 --> 02:29.590
None of my sisters are married yet.

02:29.590 --> 02:31.590
Grandmother must have her reasons.

02:33.710 --> 02:34.590
Only Old Madam Rong

02:34.590 --> 02:36.079
would believe his sweet talk.

02:36.079 --> 02:37.840
He's a scheming, silver-tongued scoundrel.

02:37.840 --> 02:40.040
Whoever marries him is bound to suffer.

02:42.470 --> 02:44.800
Miss Rong, Old Madam Rong
wants to see you.

02:45.079 --> 02:47.680
Has this matter reached
Chongxi Hall so quickly?

02:47.680 --> 02:49.079
I'll go see Grandmother.

02:49.640 --> 02:50.640
As for Mr. Yang,

02:51.050 --> 02:52.910
he'll have to stay
in the guest room for now.

02:52.910 --> 02:54.240
Without my permission,

02:54.310 --> 02:55.690
he's not allowed to wander around.

02:55.690 --> 02:56.530
-Yes!
-Yes!

03:01.860 --> 03:03.670
[Rong's Ancestral Temple]

03:24.030 --> 03:24.829
Grandmother.

03:26.360 --> 03:27.710
However accomplished

03:28.310 --> 03:29.310
you may be,

03:30.560 --> 03:32.620
when it comes to matters of the heart,

03:33.280 --> 03:34.940
you still fall short of Yunxi.

03:36.030 --> 03:38.750
She knew there was a vast gap
between their stations,

03:38.750 --> 03:40.190
and their families were worlds apart.

03:40.190 --> 03:42.990
Even with love,
they could never be a proper match.

03:43.450 --> 03:46.190
So she chose to devote herself
to the family business,

03:46.190 --> 03:48.320
never speaking of personal feelings,

03:49.030 --> 03:51.490
and sparing no effort
to amass great wealth.

03:52.000 --> 03:53.310
How could Li's future

03:53.750 --> 03:54.750
ever be lacking?

03:56.190 --> 03:57.079
What a pity.

03:58.620 --> 04:00.620
She lacked patience and endurance,

04:01.560 --> 04:03.310
rushed to outshine you,

04:03.870 --> 04:05.310
and mistook a mere bandit

04:05.310 --> 04:06.870
for a bringer of fortune.

04:09.590 --> 04:10.520
How ridiculous.

04:11.430 --> 04:13.430
Nothing escapes you, Grandmother.

04:13.920 --> 04:15.800
You've known about
Li's true identity all along.

04:15.800 --> 04:17.930
If you hadn't brought
that child back,

04:18.519 --> 04:21.180
I would have acknowledged
her heritage myself.

04:21.240 --> 04:22.480
The descendant of our Rong family

04:22.480 --> 04:24.240
cannot be raised by outsiders.

04:24.670 --> 04:25.750
Bring her back here

04:25.870 --> 04:27.270
and raise her properly for a few years,

04:27.270 --> 04:29.000
so she won't end up like Yunshu,

04:30.190 --> 04:31.630
brought up by her mother

04:32.000 --> 04:33.480
to be submissive,

04:33.800 --> 04:35.120
timid, and meek,

04:36.159 --> 04:38.620
lacking the bearing
of a true Rong daughter.

04:38.800 --> 04:40.800
Yunshu is naturally gentle and shy.

04:41.120 --> 04:43.570
Though she may not be
as perceptive as Yunxi,

04:43.570 --> 04:45.190
she makes up for it
with kindness, humility,

04:45.190 --> 04:46.320
and wide knowledge,

04:46.630 --> 04:48.890
far surpassing the mischievous Yunyin.

04:49.000 --> 04:50.870
She is also dutiful to you, Grandmother,

04:50.870 --> 04:52.870
always the first to pay her respects.

04:52.870 --> 04:53.930
Enough about them.

04:56.360 --> 04:57.040
Bao.

04:58.950 --> 05:00.410
Have you made up your mind?

05:01.920 --> 05:02.720
Grandmother.

05:03.560 --> 05:04.890
I have made my decision.

05:06.070 --> 05:08.470
And I hope for your blessing, Grandmother.

05:12.270 --> 05:13.600
42 years ago,

05:14.190 --> 05:15.390
I too was married here

05:15.480 --> 05:17.870
beneath the paired pillar.

05:19.510 --> 05:21.600
He was just like your Mr. Lu,

05:22.120 --> 05:23.560
handsome and talented,

05:24.160 --> 05:25.820
exceptionally intelligent,

05:26.160 --> 05:27.800
with rare wisdom.

05:29.310 --> 05:30.390
All who saw him

05:30.680 --> 05:32.680
could not help but feel admiration.

05:34.070 --> 05:34.870
That year,

05:35.800 --> 05:36.600
I was escorting

05:36.600 --> 05:38.200
a tea shipment for my mother.

05:38.870 --> 05:41.560
Our boat was docked
with curtains half-drawn.

05:42.480 --> 05:43.920
He was reading by candlelight.

05:43.920 --> 05:45.750
The reeds are lush and green.

05:45.750 --> 05:47.350
I fell for him at first sight.

05:47.820 --> 05:49.310
He was the only son

05:49.710 --> 05:51.100
of an official family.

05:51.970 --> 05:53.960
His parents threatened to kill themselves

05:53.960 --> 05:55.800
if he married into the Rong family.

05:55.800 --> 05:57.440
Yet he chose to elope with me.

05:58.600 --> 06:00.430
How devoted and loyal he was.

06:01.390 --> 06:03.450
So, despite my parents' objections,

06:03.800 --> 06:05.430
I secretly brought him here

06:06.190 --> 06:07.650
and we vowed to be married.

06:08.270 --> 06:09.670
Grandmother, do you mean

06:10.720 --> 06:12.320
my biological grandfather?

06:15.800 --> 06:16.430
Look.

06:17.000 --> 06:17.600
Does he

06:17.800 --> 06:20.040
deserve to be your grandfather?

06:32.240 --> 06:34.159
I grew up in the tea plantation.

06:35.430 --> 06:37.070
Beyond knowing tea,

06:37.870 --> 06:40.430
I understood little of the ways
of the world or the hearts of men.

06:40.430 --> 06:42.890
It was my first time
traveling far from home.

06:43.190 --> 06:44.600
I never suspected

06:44.920 --> 06:47.870
why that boat would dock

06:47.870 --> 06:49.120
right next to mine,

06:49.750 --> 06:52.010
and why the cabin doors faced each other,

06:52.270 --> 06:54.190
allowing me to instantly fall for

06:54.360 --> 06:56.430
that young master reading by candlelight.

06:56.430 --> 06:57.750
I never imagined

06:59.310 --> 07:00.070
that people

07:01.310 --> 07:03.750
could be so calculating
against the innocent.

07:03.750 --> 07:06.010
His entire family staged a performance,

07:08.000 --> 07:09.630
all to deceive me

07:10.720 --> 07:12.920
and seize the secret of tea cultivation

07:13.000 --> 07:15.260
to rescue their failing family fortune.

07:15.720 --> 07:18.120
While I was fighting
for my life in childbirth,

07:18.120 --> 07:20.120
he stole the precious tea seedlings

07:20.480 --> 07:21.240
and my hand-written

07:21.240 --> 07:22.270
tea manual,

07:23.000 --> 07:25.000
then returned to his hometown

07:25.000 --> 07:26.530
with his beautiful cousin.

07:28.040 --> 07:29.510
His little scheme

07:30.480 --> 07:32.310
couldn't fool my mother.

07:33.000 --> 07:34.330
She lured him into a trap

07:35.270 --> 07:36.800
and brought him before me,

07:37.630 --> 07:39.240
to be dealt with as I pleased.

07:54.390 --> 07:56.270
I could have killed him,

07:57.430 --> 07:59.190
but I decided to let him go

08:00.190 --> 08:01.920
to bear the consequences

08:01.920 --> 08:03.240
of his own actions.

08:09.640 --> 08:11.560
Later, he fell into disgrace,

08:12.910 --> 08:14.270
ruined and destitute.

08:15.210 --> 08:17.540
Hunted down by creditors and disfigured,

08:17.870 --> 08:19.730
he came back to beg me for his life.

08:21.100 --> 08:23.540
I kept him in the ancestral hall

08:25.720 --> 08:27.830
as a warning to future generations.

08:28.560 --> 08:31.160
As long as you're a daughter
of our Rong family,

08:31.630 --> 08:33.270
fortune hunters

08:33.510 --> 08:35.390
will be as numerous as fish in the river.

08:35.390 --> 08:36.549
Handsome and talented men

08:36.549 --> 08:38.200
will be yours for the taking.

08:39.150 --> 08:40.880
But once you indulge in romance

08:41.789 --> 08:42.990
and forget your duty,

08:45.000 --> 08:46.800
this is the fate that awaits you.

08:54.790 --> 08:56.050
I have taken your words

08:57.580 --> 08:58.910
to heart, Grandmother.

08:59.720 --> 09:00.390
Good.

09:01.790 --> 09:03.670
Then swear it

09:04.240 --> 09:05.500
before our ancestors.

09:23.910 --> 09:26.370
May the Rong family
ancestors bear witness,

09:26.840 --> 09:28.790
I, Rong Shanbao, swear today,

09:29.720 --> 09:30.480
that in my lifetime, I shall devote myself

09:30.480 --> 09:33.320
to the revitalization
of the tea of our Rong family.

09:33.320 --> 09:36.030
In all matters, the prosperity of
our family shall come first.

09:36.030 --> 09:37.390
May my humble efforts

09:37.840 --> 09:39.550
contribute to something greater,

09:39.550 --> 09:41.040
like the faint light of a firefly

09:41.040 --> 09:42.720
adding brightness to the sun and moon.

09:42.720 --> 09:44.450
Through countless hardships,

09:44.670 --> 09:46.400
my resolve shall never change.

09:47.310 --> 09:49.010
What if the man you marry

09:49.030 --> 09:50.430
betrays the Rong family?

09:52.870 --> 09:53.480
Tell me.

09:54.000 --> 09:54.600
Tell me!

10:04.600 --> 10:06.080
If Mr. Lu betrays the Rong family

10:06.080 --> 10:07.120
in the future,

10:08.600 --> 10:10.200
he shall be my enemy.

10:11.870 --> 10:13.560
I will cut all ties with him,

10:14.580 --> 10:15.580
and show no mercy.

10:16.270 --> 10:17.600
Swear it upon yourself.

10:31.000 --> 10:32.060
If I break even half

10:33.070 --> 10:34.130
a word of this oath,

10:35.960 --> 10:37.910
may my husband leave and children scatter,

10:37.910 --> 10:38.960
my life cut short,

10:40.130 --> 10:42.190
and may I die without a resting place.

10:42.360 --> 10:43.000
Good.

10:45.080 --> 10:46.610
Remember what you've said.

10:53.200 --> 10:54.930
If you break your word someday,

10:56.320 --> 10:58.050
the vow you made will come true.

11:19.870 --> 11:20.630
Rest assured, My Lord.

11:20.090 --> 11:22.700
[Minister Xu]

11:20.840 --> 11:21.840
Once we reach the ferry,

11:21.840 --> 11:22.790
we'll sail south

11:23.270 --> 11:24.070
day and night,

11:24.270 --> 11:27.130
and we should be in Linji
before the end of the month.

11:46.190 --> 11:48.220
[Xu Meiying]

11:53.670 --> 11:57.580
[Rong Mansion]

11:56.010 --> 11:57.470
Take this silk over there.

12:08.360 --> 12:09.620
Align it with this one.

12:20.910 --> 12:21.670
Be careful.

12:29.870 --> 12:30.930
Bring it over here.

12:33.080 --> 12:34.670
Move the flowerpot over there.

12:34.670 --> 12:35.390
Yes.

12:47.600 --> 12:48.960
Come on, hurry.

12:49.440 --> 12:50.640
Be careful. This way.

12:51.480 --> 12:52.150
Be careful.

12:52.790 --> 12:53.440
Watch out.

12:54.150 --> 12:55.150
Come on, quickly.

12:58.240 --> 12:58.790
Let's go.

13:03.870 --> 13:04.470
Come here.

13:15.840 --> 13:16.960
You know what to do?

13:17.320 --> 13:18.120
I understand.

13:40.840 --> 13:42.480
You promised not to lose your temper,

13:42.480 --> 13:44.480
and you'd better keep that promise.

13:48.720 --> 13:51.050
You think I'd throw a fit
over a mere title?

13:52.120 --> 13:54.120
You've clearly underestimated me.

13:54.720 --> 13:56.950
On the surface, everything seems bright,

13:56.950 --> 13:58.080
yet like fire on oil,

13:58.440 --> 14:00.630
it could turn

14:01.720 --> 14:02.850
for better or worse.

14:05.080 --> 14:06.010
What do you mean?

14:09.630 --> 14:11.290
Lady Rong had three husbands.

14:11.750 --> 14:13.030
Some died, some left.

14:13.550 --> 14:15.600
Finding another is just how things are.

14:15.600 --> 14:17.030
Fortune rises and falls.

14:17.390 --> 14:19.120
No one stays at the top forever.

14:20.670 --> 14:22.330
There's plenty of time ahead.

14:23.120 --> 14:24.720
He won't be winning forever.

14:25.270 --> 14:26.200
Lady Rong

14:27.020 --> 14:28.280
won't allow it either.

14:31.910 --> 14:33.110
You had a grand-uncle

14:33.270 --> 14:34.870
who once entered the Rong household

14:34.870 --> 14:36.440
and won the favor of Lady Rong.

14:36.440 --> 14:38.170
But he was frail and died young,

14:38.320 --> 14:39.520
leaving no children.

14:39.840 --> 14:41.150
If he had lived longer,

14:41.670 --> 14:42.320
perhaps

14:42.630 --> 14:43.790
you might have had

14:43.790 --> 14:44.920
some close cousins.

14:46.200 --> 14:47.460
Did none of your elders

14:47.480 --> 14:49.480
ever tell you of these things?

14:50.440 --> 14:51.270
You seem

14:51.550 --> 14:53.350
completely unaware of all this.

14:53.630 --> 14:55.480
I've been studying tea
in the mountains since childhood.

14:55.480 --> 14:56.540
I've never heard of

14:57.240 --> 14:58.300
these old stories.

15:02.240 --> 15:02.970
Who's there?

15:05.600 --> 15:06.240
Stop!

15:08.360 --> 15:09.360
Stop right there!

15:16.870 --> 15:18.130
Well? Do you catch him?

15:18.750 --> 15:19.550
Young Master.

15:28.120 --> 15:29.180
The paper is blank.

15:29.240 --> 15:30.440
What's there to hide?

15:30.510 --> 15:31.870
There are many ways to send messages.

15:31.870 --> 15:33.130
If it truly were blank,

15:33.200 --> 15:34.200
why go to all the trouble

15:34.200 --> 15:35.200
of delivering it?

15:35.390 --> 15:37.590
There must be something hidden within.

15:38.270 --> 15:39.750
Mr. Yan, you always say

15:39.750 --> 15:41.610
that Lu Fusheng is kind-hearted.

15:42.270 --> 15:43.530
How about we make a bet?

15:55.200 --> 15:57.480
The master is not at home.
It's not appropriate to open the door.

15:57.480 --> 15:58.440
Who's there?

15:58.870 --> 15:59.870
We're from the Government Office.

15:59.870 --> 16:02.070
Clerk Qing sent me to deliver a message.

16:05.960 --> 16:07.090
That heartless man.

16:07.360 --> 16:08.910
He hasn't been seen for over ten days,

16:08.910 --> 16:09.440
and I thought

16:09.440 --> 16:10.910
he'd been scared off by me,

16:11.240 --> 16:12.440
leaving me all alone.

16:13.560 --> 16:15.890
My apologies for the wait. Please come in.

16:23.510 --> 16:24.370
Please come in.

16:25.270 --> 16:26.910
He was called to go with Magistrate Wang

16:26.910 --> 16:28.170
to inspect the fields.

16:28.510 --> 16:30.240
He didn't have time to inform you.

16:30.240 --> 16:31.440
Before leaving, he specifically asked us

16:31.440 --> 16:33.480
to bring some firewood, wine, and meat,

16:33.480 --> 16:35.280
along with pastries and fruits,

16:35.360 --> 16:36.960
so you wouldn't be waiting in vain.

16:36.960 --> 16:37.960
We were delayed by official matters

16:37.960 --> 16:39.090
these past few days.

16:39.510 --> 16:41.390
So we're late. Please don't blame us.

16:41.390 --> 16:42.790
No worries at all.

16:43.390 --> 16:44.240
I'm not short of

16:44.240 --> 16:45.750
food or firewood here.

16:46.120 --> 16:47.600
Thank you for checking in on me.

16:47.600 --> 16:49.320
I'll call the maid to make some tea.

16:49.320 --> 16:50.720
Have a cup of tea before you leave.

16:50.720 --> 16:52.240
Ms. Xu! Ms. Xu!

16:52.270 --> 16:52.910
Mrs. Qing.

16:55.360 --> 16:56.960
Do you recognize this token?

16:58.550 --> 16:59.510
Clerk Qing said

16:59.910 --> 17:01.720
the Master has grown suspicious.

17:01.720 --> 17:03.040
The item on your house beam

17:03.040 --> 17:03.950
could cause trouble.

17:03.950 --> 17:05.609
I'm to find it and take it away,

17:05.960 --> 17:07.819
before it brings disaster on you.

17:09.310 --> 17:09.920
Wait here.

17:23.790 --> 17:24.400
Here.

17:28.000 --> 17:28.750
That will do.

17:37.920 --> 17:38.920
Magistrate Lang,

17:39.790 --> 17:41.070
I've treated you well,

17:41.830 --> 17:43.440
and this is how you repay me?

17:46.160 --> 17:46.760
Seize him.

18:02.750 --> 18:03.440
Miss Rong.

18:03.790 --> 18:05.440
All young ladies
have brought gifts to you,

18:05.440 --> 18:07.300
and they're all waiting outside.

18:07.350 --> 18:08.010
Let them in.

18:08.440 --> 18:09.070
Yes.

18:22.200 --> 18:23.800
Congratulations, Shanbao.

18:25.160 --> 18:26.420
This pair of bracelets

18:26.510 --> 18:28.110
was personally chosen by Li.

18:28.750 --> 18:30.070
May you and Mr. Lu

18:30.200 --> 18:32.460
be blessed by the spirits and ancestors,

18:32.480 --> 18:34.160
and live in harmony and happiness

18:34.160 --> 18:35.200
for all eternity.

18:39.240 --> 18:40.350
Thank Li for me.

18:41.200 --> 18:43.350
Hualin Courtyard is filled with riches,

18:43.350 --> 18:45.150
yet you've never cared for them.

18:45.550 --> 18:47.010
Today is your wedding day,

18:47.590 --> 18:49.050
I can offer nothing grand,

18:49.790 --> 18:51.520
only this set of glass tea cups,

18:52.110 --> 18:53.770
as my gift of congratulation.

19:02.960 --> 19:04.290
No wonder the poem says,

19:04.440 --> 19:05.790
"Colored like cold ice;

19:05.790 --> 19:07.440
Nothing obscures its clarity."

19:07.440 --> 19:08.720
They're so crystal clear

19:08.720 --> 19:10.350
that you can see your reflection in them.

19:10.350 --> 19:11.160
They're even better than the ones

19:11.160 --> 19:13.020
Grandmother received last year.

19:22.200 --> 19:23.640
Today is a good day,

19:23.750 --> 19:25.720
so Grandmother showed you mercy
and gave you the day off.

19:25.720 --> 19:27.120
Don't cause any trouble.

19:42.310 --> 19:44.280
This is the first autumn tea
from the plantation.

19:44.280 --> 19:46.140
I picked and processed it myself,

19:46.680 --> 19:49.080
as a congratulatory gift for you, Shanbao.

19:50.260 --> 19:52.520
It's good to see you
show such sincere remorse

19:52.520 --> 19:54.480
and specially pick
autumn tea as an offering.

19:54.480 --> 19:56.880
Grandmother would be pleased to know this.

19:57.370 --> 19:58.060
Xiu Qiong.

19:58.830 --> 20:00.400
Take this to Chongxi Hall

20:01.000 --> 20:03.000
and invite Grandmother to taste it.

20:04.160 --> 20:04.720
No.

20:07.260 --> 20:09.260
This tea... this tea can't be drunk.

20:10.110 --> 20:11.710
I accidentally scorched it.

20:12.070 --> 20:14.000
I'll go back and make a fresh batch.

20:16.030 --> 20:17.030
It can't be drunk?

20:18.240 --> 20:19.030
What a pity.

20:19.780 --> 20:21.830
I had thought of how you've been

20:21.830 --> 20:24.130
working diligently in the tea plantation,

20:24.130 --> 20:25.550
and intended to persuade Grandmother

20:25.550 --> 20:27.020
to let you return home sooner.

20:27.020 --> 20:28.190
Since your tea-making skills

20:28.190 --> 20:29.520
aren't quite there yet,

20:29.620 --> 20:30.920
you'd better stay there

20:30.920 --> 20:32.510
and practice for another two years.

20:32.510 --> 20:34.830
What? Two years?

20:35.420 --> 20:36.820
Are you trying to kill me?

20:46.350 --> 20:48.210
Yunyin, you've been so careless.

20:48.240 --> 20:49.370
How did this happen?

20:54.310 --> 20:55.590
Your heart is black to the core.

20:55.590 --> 20:56.790
Who'd ever marry you?

20:57.350 --> 20:58.750
That precious Lu of yours

20:59.000 --> 21:01.160
is only lusting after your looks
and coveting power.

21:01.160 --> 21:03.290
But he'll regret it bitterly someday!

21:07.200 --> 21:08.600
And all you bootlickers,

21:09.110 --> 21:10.440
prattling on about "a perfect match"

21:10.440 --> 21:11.680
and "a match made in heaven."

21:11.680 --> 21:12.480
In my eyes,

21:13.020 --> 21:14.880
they're completely mismatched.

21:15.000 --> 21:16.480
The fighting and betrayal

21:16.480 --> 21:17.340
are yet to come!

21:26.240 --> 21:26.920
Yunshu.

21:27.710 --> 21:28.960
What have you brought?

21:28.960 --> 21:29.640
Let me see.

21:35.480 --> 21:37.350
I strung these fortune beads myself.

21:37.350 --> 21:39.350
They'll bring you good luck, Shanbao.

21:39.350 --> 21:40.720
May bad omens never come true,

21:40.720 --> 21:42.030
and only the good ones do.

21:42.030 --> 21:43.830
Those who spread rumors and cause trouble

21:43.830 --> 21:45.200
will eventually face

21:45.200 --> 21:46.200
their own karma.

21:54.640 --> 21:56.590
Thank you for
your skillful handiwork, Yunshu.

21:56.590 --> 21:58.520
Your gift couldn't be more timely.

22:10.310 --> 22:11.640
It's only early autumn.

22:11.920 --> 22:13.580
These socks are far too thick.

22:14.790 --> 22:15.850
I'll roast in them.

22:17.830 --> 22:19.240
There's no need to go to all this trouble.

22:19.240 --> 22:20.110
Change them.

22:20.240 --> 22:21.310
That won't do.

22:22.480 --> 22:23.350
Young Master, after

22:23.350 --> 22:24.400
paying respects to ancestors
in the ancestral hall today,

22:24.400 --> 22:26.030
you'll officially be the Rong family's
eldest son-in-law.

22:26.030 --> 22:27.590
Our wedding customs
differ from those of others.

22:27.590 --> 22:29.590
There are no red ribbons
or cross-cup wine.

22:29.590 --> 22:30.830
The young ladies will gather
in the bridal chamber

22:30.830 --> 22:31.830
to celebrate the auspicious day.

22:31.830 --> 22:32.680
If they catch the groom,

22:32.680 --> 22:34.030
they'll certainly make mischief.

22:34.030 --> 22:35.790
Young Master, you must sneak
into the room in the dark,

22:35.790 --> 22:36.920
without being seen.

22:37.200 --> 22:39.530
Walking barefoot would be the safest way.

22:40.790 --> 22:41.920
What happens if they

22:42.030 --> 22:42.880
catch me?

22:43.400 --> 22:44.720
If they take you away,

22:45.030 --> 22:47.430
even Miss Rong won't
be able to get you back.

22:52.200 --> 22:53.130
Where is Jun Dai?

22:54.000 --> 22:55.510
I sent him to check the tea room.

22:55.510 --> 22:57.040
Why hasn't he returned yet?

23:17.510 --> 23:18.790
These are the gifts presented by

23:18.790 --> 23:20.440
the various households in the city,
as well as by the Rong family's

23:20.440 --> 23:21.700
tea shops and estates.

23:21.790 --> 23:23.510
Miss Rong informed us beforehand,

23:23.510 --> 23:25.000
and we know you prefer simplicity

23:25.000 --> 23:26.240
and dislike extravagance.

23:26.240 --> 23:28.000
So the gifts are mostly scholarly items,

23:28.000 --> 23:29.590
antiques, calligraphy and paintings.

23:29.590 --> 23:31.480
Miss Rong ordered them all brought here

23:31.480 --> 23:33.080
for your inspection, Mr. Lu.

23:38.350 --> 23:39.110
I misspoke.

23:39.880 --> 23:41.940
I should address you as Young Master.

23:42.350 --> 23:43.510
After you've seen them, Young Master,

23:43.510 --> 23:45.160
please select the ones
you like to display,

23:45.160 --> 23:47.620
and the rest will
be stored in the storeroom.

24:38.200 --> 24:39.260
Just these will do.

24:41.400 --> 24:41.960
Yes.

24:42.960 --> 24:43.760
Young Master!

24:47.160 --> 24:48.480
Well, Jun Dai.

24:49.140 --> 24:51.030
Today I need to serve tea to Lady Rong.

24:51.030 --> 24:52.270
I sent you to check the tea room,

24:52.270 --> 24:54.070
yet you return at this late hour?

24:54.200 --> 24:55.590
If it weren't such an auspicious day,

24:55.590 --> 24:57.320
you'd certainly get a beating.

24:57.830 --> 24:58.920
Please calm down, Young Master.

24:58.920 --> 25:00.680
I've carefully checked everything.

25:00.680 --> 25:01.810
And the tea is ready.

25:20.510 --> 25:21.310
Young Master.

25:21.880 --> 25:22.750
Last night, Lord Lang

25:22.750 --> 25:24.290
left the government office
with two of his confidants

25:24.290 --> 25:25.820
and hasn't returned since.

25:27.680 --> 25:28.240
Oh no.

25:29.880 --> 25:30.480
He must have not

25:30.480 --> 25:31.350
taken my advice

25:31.400 --> 25:33.390
and has gone to fetch that ledger himself,

25:33.390 --> 25:35.320
only to fall right into their trap.

25:39.440 --> 25:40.240
Mr. Lu,

25:41.400 --> 25:42.830
where are you heading?

26:07.480 --> 26:08.400
Someone has sent

26:08.400 --> 26:09.730
a secret letter for you.

26:10.830 --> 26:12.230
Heating it over the flame

26:12.350 --> 26:14.350
reveals its contents.

26:15.580 --> 26:16.910
You came to this mansion

26:17.240 --> 26:19.230
for this person's whereabouts, right?

26:19.230 --> 26:20.550
I don't know anything
about any secret letter.

26:20.550 --> 26:22.550
Don't worry. I'm not deceiving you.

26:23.000 --> 26:24.400
I went to see it myself

26:24.610 --> 26:26.540
and it really gave me quite a shock.

26:29.510 --> 26:30.680
If I call out loudly,

26:31.000 --> 26:33.160
you'll be in serious trouble.

26:33.710 --> 26:34.510
I advise you

26:34.790 --> 26:36.160
not to act rashly.

26:40.720 --> 26:42.120
What exactly do you want?

26:43.720 --> 26:44.880
Earlier,

26:45.070 --> 26:46.870
I heard something outside about

26:47.000 --> 26:48.960
someone having gone missing.

26:50.680 --> 26:51.920
Now you're in a bind.

26:52.480 --> 26:55.400
Between saving a life and
the wedding at the ancestral hall,

26:55.400 --> 26:58.110
you can only choose one.

27:11.790 --> 27:15.100
[Rong's Ancestral Temple]

27:16.200 --> 27:17.000
Young Master.

27:17.480 --> 27:18.240
Young Master.

27:18.240 --> 27:20.370
You must not miss the auspicious hour.

27:32.510 --> 27:33.770
I cannot let Madam Yang

27:33.960 --> 27:35.290
be taken by anyone else.

27:39.160 --> 27:40.360
Go tell Lady Shanbao.

27:40.890 --> 27:41.440
I've got

27:41.440 --> 27:42.700
a life-or-death case.

27:43.160 --> 27:44.560
I'll be back right after.

27:45.390 --> 27:46.660
Tell her to wait for me.

27:48.310 --> 27:49.110
Young Master!

28:34.960 --> 28:35.680
See?

28:36.120 --> 28:37.550
I told you so.

29:00.590 --> 29:01.990
What are you waiting for?

29:02.480 --> 29:03.480
How humiliating!

29:04.030 --> 29:04.640
It has always been

29:04.640 --> 29:06.070
the women of our Rong family
who choose others.

29:06.070 --> 29:07.200
Since when have we allowed

29:07.200 --> 29:08.660
anyone to trample over us?

29:08.750 --> 29:09.880
That Lu Fusheng ought to

29:09.880 --> 29:10.680
be dragged here

29:10.680 --> 29:12.080
and have his legs broken!

29:27.960 --> 29:28.560
Miss Rong.

29:29.160 --> 29:30.620
Mr. Lu left the Rong family

29:30.830 --> 29:33.430
with many attendants
waiting for him outside.

29:37.380 --> 29:38.470
Where did he go?

29:39.000 --> 29:40.160
The messenger said

29:40.550 --> 29:42.480
he headed toward South Tower Lane.

29:51.160 --> 29:51.790
Wanwan.

29:53.210 --> 29:54.510
Be careful.

29:58.680 --> 30:00.140
Wanwan, be careful.

30:08.440 --> 30:09.200
Mrs. Liang.

30:10.110 --> 30:11.230
Go. Hurry!

30:13.920 --> 30:14.600
Mrs. Wei.

30:16.910 --> 30:18.910
You can hide for now but not forever.

30:19.110 --> 30:20.390
Until this case is closed,

30:20.390 --> 30:22.390
you'll be hiding and living in fear.

30:22.590 --> 30:23.590
What's the point?

30:24.070 --> 30:25.800
Everything must come to an end.

30:27.790 --> 30:28.420
Please.

30:40.170 --> 30:41.240
Shanbao!

30:57.550 --> 31:02.380
♪ The moonlight chases its way
up to the mountain peak ♪

31:03.810 --> 31:09.310
♪ I lift my head and see the faint trace
of spring snow on your brow ♪

31:11.170 --> 31:16.570
♪ Years of being buried
in paperwork and official business ♪

31:18.260 --> 31:23.640
♪ Who makes the kite snap its string? ♪

31:25.350 --> 31:30.800
♪ Fate must intend for us
to be bound together ♪

31:29.150 --> 31:29.830
Lord Lu?

31:31.070 --> 31:31.710
Lord Lu.

31:32.780 --> 31:39.650
♪ That's why so many challenges are set ♪

31:40.010 --> 31:45.240
♪ I can never get enough of looking ♪

31:43.550 --> 31:44.830
I was sent by Miss Rong

31:45.240 --> 31:46.480
to bring Lady Yunwan back home.

31:46.290 --> 31:52.530
♪ At this charming
and enchanting smiling face ♪

31:47.070 --> 31:48.270
She's also a witness.

31:48.510 --> 31:49.840
You can't take her away.

31:50.480 --> 31:51.830
Our Lady Yunwan is ill,

31:52.310 --> 31:54.310
and her mind is like
that of a young child.

31:53.750 --> 32:00.410
♪ I cross mountains and rivers
to rush to your presence ♪

31:55.200 --> 31:56.030
Miss Rong specially chose

31:56.030 --> 31:58.030
a quiet courtyard for her recovery.

31:58.640 --> 31:59.240
But

32:00.160 --> 32:01.440
someone interfered along the way,

32:00.900 --> 32:07.200
♪ We face each other, tears
streaming down, yet unable to speak ♪

32:01.880 --> 32:03.310
causing today's mess.

32:04.070 --> 32:05.110
In court,

32:05.400 --> 32:07.160
the Rong family will
send someone to respond.

32:07.160 --> 32:07.830
But today

32:08.150 --> 32:14.300
♪ Afraid that the dream is just a sham,
frightening away the pair of swallows ♪

32:08.510 --> 32:10.640
I must bring her back myself.

32:11.270 --> 32:12.000
How dare you!

32:15.250 --> 32:22.280
♪ Can we, in this lifetime,
share the moon's beauty from afar? ♪

32:17.350 --> 32:18.680
I only want Madam Yang.

32:19.830 --> 32:22.090
Steward Cheng, you may act as you see fit.

32:22.480 --> 32:24.440
I won't go!

32:22.730 --> 32:29.800
♪ The myriad stars in the sky
can't fully convey our endless affection ♪

32:24.440 --> 32:26.030
Mrs. Liang, I don't want to leave!

32:26.030 --> 32:27.510
Don't leave me, Mrs. Liang!

32:27.510 --> 32:29.160
Lady Yunwan, forgive me.

32:29.830 --> 32:32.200
Mrs. Liang! Mrs. Liang!

32:29.960 --> 32:37.310
♪ The wind wafts
in countless thoughts of longing ♪

32:33.270 --> 32:34.510
Don't hurt her!

32:34.510 --> 32:36.110
Mrs. Liang!

32:37.000 --> 32:38.270
Mrs. Liang!

32:37.350 --> 32:43.680
♪ Love exists among mountains and rivers.
Who says it couldn't be fully achieved? ♪

32:38.400 --> 32:40.070
Mrs. Liang!

32:44.560 --> 32:51.180
♪ Every single day with you
feels like our very first encounter ♪

32:51.310 --> 32:52.960
I don't want to leave!

33:04.750 --> 33:05.310
Lord Lu!

33:05.870 --> 33:08.800
The Minister is waiting
for you at the county office.

33:23.000 --> 33:24.000
There's no hurry.

33:25.830 --> 33:27.000
Before I see him,

33:29.140 --> 33:31.470
there's an urgent matter I must attend to.

34:41.550 --> 34:44.080
[Linji Prefectural Office]

34:44.719 --> 34:46.780
Have I seen a ghost in broad daylight?

34:47.280 --> 34:49.190
Old Master! Old Master!

34:50.110 --> 34:51.510
A ghost, Old Master!

34:52.150 --> 34:53.070
Old Master!

34:54.000 --> 34:55.150
As you commanded, Young Master,

34:55.150 --> 34:57.280
I took the person out during the chaos.

35:04.440 --> 35:04.960
My Lord.

35:05.320 --> 35:07.320
You can't come in.

35:07.550 --> 35:08.400
You can't.

35:10.400 --> 35:10.990
My Lord!

35:11.190 --> 35:12.920
You really can't go in, My Lord!

35:18.280 --> 35:19.480
That's good, My Lord.

35:26.590 --> 35:27.440
Who are you?

35:27.890 --> 35:28.560
Lord Xu.

35:29.460 --> 35:30.390
Long time no see.

35:36.630 --> 35:37.920
How dare you

35:38.440 --> 35:40.320
break into my office!

35:40.760 --> 35:42.820
As Imperial Inspector, I have toured

35:42.960 --> 35:44.960
the counties on behalf of the Emperor.

35:44.960 --> 35:47.640
Everywhere I go, all local officials
show me respect.

35:47.640 --> 35:48.900
When my sedan arrives,

35:49.440 --> 35:50.590
even provincial governors must kneel

35:50.590 --> 35:51.880
in the rain to welcome me.

35:51.880 --> 35:52.840
Until I speak,

35:53.110 --> 35:54.230
they remain kneeling in mud,

35:54.230 --> 35:55.490
not daring to stand up.

35:55.590 --> 35:57.250
If I wish to enter your office,

35:57.730 --> 35:59.590
why would I need to force my way in?

36:01.190 --> 36:03.590
Inspector Lu died in the river,

36:04.150 --> 36:06.360
and his death notice
was sent to the capital.

36:06.360 --> 36:08.150
Who are you?

36:08.590 --> 36:11.030
Do you know that
impersonating an imperial envoy

36:11.030 --> 36:12.840
is a capital offense?

36:13.190 --> 36:15.320
I anticipated your failing eyesight,

36:15.430 --> 36:17.430
fearing you might not recognize me.

36:17.670 --> 36:19.320
So I had hidden my official robe and seal

36:19.320 --> 36:21.380
in the wall behind the kitchen stove,

36:21.630 --> 36:23.030
and just retrieved them.

36:23.650 --> 36:25.180
My Lord, spare the chatter,

36:25.630 --> 36:27.160
or it'll be a wasted effort.

36:27.980 --> 36:28.530
Jun Dai.

36:37.510 --> 36:39.370
I ran into Clerk Qing on the street

36:39.400 --> 36:41.330
a few days ago and invited him home.

36:41.590 --> 36:43.150
We had a pleasant conversation.

36:43.150 --> 36:44.810
I'd wanted to keep him longer,

36:45.000 --> 36:46.550
but knowing how much you value him

36:46.550 --> 36:48.400
and cannot bear to
be without him even for a day,

36:48.400 --> 36:50.460
I've personally returned him to you.

36:50.950 --> 36:52.630
My Lord! Save me!

36:53.020 --> 36:53.950
Help me! My Lord!

36:58.000 --> 37:00.460
I've brought your
valued talent back to you.

37:00.690 --> 37:02.770
How do you intend to repay me for it?

37:07.960 --> 37:08.710
Guards!

37:15.360 --> 37:16.480
Lu Jianglai,

37:17.320 --> 37:19.450
you're too arrogant for your own good.

37:19.570 --> 37:20.770
How dare you, Xu Song!

37:21.550 --> 37:23.710
In broad daylight, you surround

37:23.710 --> 37:25.230
an Imperial Inspector with soldiers.

37:25.230 --> 37:26.830
Are you staging a rebellion?

37:41.150 --> 37:43.920
Lord Lu, you wouldn't act this brazenly

37:44.400 --> 37:46.190
without someone to back you up.

37:49.110 --> 37:50.000
Bring them in.

37:51.590 --> 37:52.280
Lord Lang!

38:11.000 --> 38:11.590
My Lord!

38:12.630 --> 38:13.580
Save me, My Lord!

38:14.110 --> 38:14.590
My Lord!

38:21.880 --> 38:23.010
Lu Jianglai, you...

38:24.860 --> 38:25.880
My Lord!

38:26.180 --> 38:27.620
You hurt my man first.

38:28.110 --> 38:29.910
I'm merely returning the favor.

38:30.190 --> 38:31.360
Our accounts

38:32.110 --> 38:33.710
will be settled another day.

38:36.670 --> 38:37.400
Farewell.

38:57.710 --> 38:58.230
My Lord.

38:58.440 --> 38:59.510
Are you letting them go just like that?

38:59.510 --> 39:00.070
Get lost!

39:02.850 --> 39:03.560
Useless!

39:06.190 --> 39:08.110
Prepare my sedan chair.
I'm going to the Governor's office.

39:08.110 --> 39:08.590
Yes.

39:12.550 --> 39:13.510
See if he's gone!

39:18.050 --> 39:18.940
My hand hurts.

39:18.960 --> 39:20.780
[Rong Mansion]

39:34.710 --> 39:35.480
Miss Rong.

39:36.280 --> 39:38.280
To get Madam Yang out of the residence,

39:38.280 --> 39:40.190
you even faked Lady Yunwan's death.

39:40.190 --> 39:41.850
That was sheer recklessness.

39:42.360 --> 39:44.110
Old Madam Rong is still furious

39:44.190 --> 39:45.990
and probably refuses to see you.

39:52.480 --> 39:54.510
Ms. Yan, please convey
my words to Grandmother.

39:54.510 --> 39:56.480
If she wishes me to kneel
and reflect on my faults,

39:56.480 --> 39:58.360
I would not normally dare disobey.

39:58.360 --> 39:59.890
However, a storm is brewing

40:00.150 --> 40:01.920
and the Rong family will face turmoil.

40:01.920 --> 40:03.320
I have important matters to attend to,

40:03.320 --> 40:04.670
and must hurry back to handle them.

40:04.670 --> 40:06.440
After the court matter is settled,

40:06.440 --> 40:08.570
I'll come back to beg her forgiveness.

40:31.730 --> 40:33.670
So this is the bet
you wanted to make with me?

40:33.670 --> 40:34.930
I've told you already.

40:35.290 --> 40:36.860
Lu Fusheng is a court spy.

40:37.290 --> 40:39.840
He infiltrated the Rong family
with ulterior motives,

40:39.840 --> 40:41.500
yet you refused to believe me.

40:41.590 --> 40:43.200
You thought I slandered him

40:44.110 --> 40:45.110
out of jealousy.

40:45.630 --> 40:46.280
Now

40:46.960 --> 40:49.360
you've seen everything with your own eyes.

40:49.550 --> 40:51.080
For a single secret letter,

40:51.230 --> 40:53.510
he abandoned Shanbao
without a second thought.

40:53.510 --> 40:55.190
It shows that he never had
an ounce of genuine feeling.

40:55.190 --> 40:56.320
It was all pretense.

40:57.670 --> 40:58.730
And you treated him

40:59.360 --> 41:00.590
as a trusted friend,

41:01.150 --> 41:02.610
helping him at every turn.

41:03.000 --> 41:04.330
I'm afraid, in his eyes,

41:04.510 --> 41:06.310
you are nothing more than a fool.

41:07.590 --> 41:09.190
If you truly had your doubts,

41:09.360 --> 41:11.070
you should have spoken
to Miss Rong privately,

41:11.070 --> 41:12.870
so she could have been prepared.

41:13.110 --> 41:14.150
Instead, you let her be abandoned

41:14.150 --> 41:15.480
in full view of everyone.

41:15.480 --> 41:16.070
How is she

41:16.440 --> 41:18.230
supposed to face the Rong family?

41:18.230 --> 41:19.160
And how could she

41:19.880 --> 41:21.110
not be heartbroken?

41:24.110 --> 41:25.510
She trampled on my heart,

41:27.070 --> 41:29.730
and you still want me
to care about her feelings?

41:30.630 --> 41:31.830
Let her feel the pain.

41:32.880 --> 41:35.610
Only when she's deeply hurt
will she understand,

41:35.960 --> 41:38.360
cut ties with that deceiver

41:39.590 --> 41:41.000
and turn against him.

41:51.590 --> 41:52.920
I'm from the Yang family!

41:52.920 --> 41:53.760
Let me out!

41:54.230 --> 41:55.030
Open the door!

41:55.070 --> 41:57.160
I order you to open the door immediately!

41:57.160 --> 41:58.420
I need to see Miss Rong!

41:58.800 --> 41:59.600
Open the door.

42:10.030 --> 42:10.760
Miss Rong.

42:11.400 --> 42:12.630
I came here as a guest.

42:13.150 --> 42:13.920
Is this how your Rong family

42:13.920 --> 42:14.780
treats guests?

42:14.920 --> 42:15.880
What law have I broken

42:15.880 --> 42:17.110
that you must imprison me?

42:17.110 --> 42:18.710
You are utterly heartless.

42:19.110 --> 42:20.570
We all know perfectly well

42:20.750 --> 42:21.840
why you came here.

42:22.230 --> 42:23.490
Spare me the pretense.

42:24.320 --> 42:25.850
Go back and tell your father

42:26.940 --> 42:29.600
that Madam Yang has been
taken by the officials.

42:43.070 --> 42:44.000
Miss Rong.

42:44.400 --> 42:45.190
You should give

42:45.190 --> 42:46.990
our Yang family an explanation.

42:47.150 --> 42:47.950
Explanation?

42:49.030 --> 42:49.630
I never

42:49.630 --> 42:51.480
pushed my own sister into a living hell,

42:51.480 --> 42:53.000
and ruined her entire life

42:53.000 --> 42:54.710
just to curry favor with the Wei family.

42:54.710 --> 42:55.480
I never stood by

42:55.480 --> 42:56.840
and watched my closest kin suffer torment

42:56.840 --> 42:58.440
for the sake of the immense profits

42:58.440 --> 42:59.540
the Wei family promised.

42:59.540 --> 43:00.290
And I certainly never

43:00.290 --> 43:02.190
tried to take possession
of the Wei family's tea plantation

43:02.190 --> 43:04.920
by accusing my brother-in-law
of killing his wife.

43:04.920 --> 43:05.960
It was clearly your Rong family

43:05.960 --> 43:07.360
who harbored a criminal first.

43:07.360 --> 43:08.760
When our Yang family
found no trace of her,

43:08.760 --> 43:10.760
only then did we accuse
Wei Kejian of murdering her.

43:10.760 --> 43:12.150
Now that the truth has come to light

43:12.150 --> 43:13.800
and my family faces utter ruin.

43:13.800 --> 43:14.510
How can your Rong family

43:14.510 --> 43:15.840
stay out of this matter?

43:15.880 --> 43:16.360
Father.

43:18.070 --> 43:19.530
Our Rong family sheltered

43:19.840 --> 43:21.150
a pitiful woman who had
been beaten by her husband

43:21.150 --> 43:23.440
and mother-in-law,
causing her to miscarry.

43:23.440 --> 43:24.280
She was bedridden

43:24.280 --> 43:26.030
for three months and barely survived.

43:26.030 --> 43:27.230
She committed no murder

43:27.230 --> 43:28.000
and no crime of any kind.

43:28.000 --> 43:29.630
How can you call her a criminal?

43:29.630 --> 43:31.140
Even if this were
brought before the court,

43:31.140 --> 43:33.230
she would appear as a witness,
not an accused.

43:33.230 --> 43:34.550
And you want to shift the blame

43:34.550 --> 43:36.480
for false accusation onto others?

43:36.590 --> 43:37.110
Where

43:37.110 --> 43:38.440
is there such a bargain?

43:38.880 --> 43:39.360
You...

43:39.360 --> 43:39.840
Father.

46:14.060 --> 46:16.480
[Lu Yu, the Sage of Tea]

46:16.390 --> 46:17.990
I never imagined that people

46:18.330 --> 46:20.620
could be so calculating
against the innocent.

46:20.620 --> 46:22.880
His entire family staged a performance,

46:25.030 --> 46:26.600
all to deceive me

46:27.740 --> 46:29.940
and seize the secret of tea cultivation

46:29.940 --> 46:32.200
to rescue their failing family fortune.

46:32.710 --> 46:35.110
While I was fighting
for my life in childbirth,

46:35.110 --> 46:37.110
he stole the precious tea seedlings

46:37.490 --> 46:39.290
and my hand-written tea manuel.

46:40.580 --> 46:43.060
Lu Yu was a tea scholar
of the Tang dynasty

46:43.260 --> 46:45.260
and the author of The Classic of Tea.

46:45.660 --> 46:47.210
Tea farmers and merchants
of the Tang Dynasty

46:47.210 --> 46:49.320
regarded him as
the patron saint of tea industry.

46:49.320 --> 46:50.110
Some tea merchants

46:50.110 --> 46:51.190
display his statue

46:51.190 --> 46:53.110
in their shops.

46:53.260 --> 46:54.450
When business was good,

46:54.450 --> 46:56.000
they would offer flowers and fruits.

46:56.000 --> 46:57.060
When business was poor,

46:57.060 --> 46:59.390
they would pour hot water over his statue.

46:59.590 --> 47:01.880
His figurines were even

47:01.880 --> 47:04.230
sold together with

47:04.440 --> 47:05.590
tea sets,

47:05.760 --> 47:07.480
much like tea pets.

47:07.940 --> 47:08.820
If you ask why did tea merchants

47:08.820 --> 47:10.150
of Tang-dynasty behave this way?

47:10.150 --> 47:11.230
It was because

47:11.950 --> 47:12.650
The Classic of Tea

47:12.650 --> 47:14.590
had propelled
the tea industry into prominence.

47:14.590 --> 47:16.320
As the poet Mei Yaochen once wrote,

47:16.320 --> 47:17.780
"Since Lu Yu came into the world,

47:17.780 --> 47:20.220
people have learned
to appreciate spring tea."

47:20.220 --> 47:21.130
In a sense,

47:21.190 --> 47:22.860
it was Lu Yu who transformed tea

47:22.860 --> 47:25.370
from a local product into a luxury item,

47:25.680 --> 47:28.400
enabling tea farmers and merchants
alike to amass wealth.
